],"best_idea":"Endurance sets a knockout window below zero health: a hit that leaves health under 1 knocks the fighter out while health plus Endurance is still at least 1, and only a larger hit kills.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"A knockout window in the one health ledger fits the Pit and zone fights better than instant death; adapt because the code is LGPL-3.0 (shape only), the mastery-add defect D1 and recovery-order defect D2 must be fixed, and the luck-halving resist is random per hit and needs a server-replayable RNG before any port.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A fighter with 5 health and Endurance 20 takes a 22-damage hit and is unconscious (health -17, -17 + 20 = 3); a 30-damage hit kills (health -25, -5); a server test asserts both outcomes in the one health ledger."}
